# Demo Music Folder

Place your MOD/XM/S3M/IT tracker files here for demo mode playback.

## Supported formats:
- .mod (Amiga ProTracker)
- .xm (FastTracker II)
- .s3m (Scream Tracker 3)
- .it (Impulse Tracker)
- .stm (Scream Tracker 2)
- .mtm (MultiTracker)

## Required on Linux:
Install one of these MOD players:
- xmp: `sudo apt install xmp`
- mikmod: `sudo apt install mikmod`
- openmpt123: `sudo apt install libopenmpt-tools`

## Finding MOD files:
- https://modarchive.org/
- https://amp.dascene.net/
- https://ftp.modland.com/
